を付けた璃奈の顔でお願いします\nhttps://toy.bandai.co.jp/topics/detail/3361/\nポーズはズボンに手を入れている状態で、表情はすまし顔のウインク\n以上よろしくお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wakahima0099/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/20c23291/uploads/origins/547a6440-1056-4257-b38a-71214cc01bae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0f3a0ab50c6cebb54aa2121091d96d5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/20c23291/uploads/origins/547a6440-1056-4257-b38a-71214cc01bae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0f3a0ab50c6cebb54aa2121091d96d5, https://si.imgix.net/20c23291/uploads/origins/547a6440-1056-4257-b38a-71214cc01bae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3b79aa933d34fb6cf273305b47834b4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/20c23291/uploads/origins/547a6440-1056-4257-b38a-71214cc01bae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c30f7b08d34fa377c91a5c94e176059 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "https://skeb.jp/@wakahima0099/works/10\nこちらのゆうぽむが素敵だったのでまたリクエストさせていただきます\n上記のギャルヶ咲衣装交換の上原歩夢と高咲侑のデートシチュエーションイラストをお願いします(歩夢が侑のスラックス服で、侑が歩夢のスカート服)\n構造は膝から上までで、手を繋いでいる状況\n上記のように歩夢は笑顔で侑は少し照れた表情でお願いします\n以上よろしくお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wakahima0099/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/960473f1/uploads/origins/ad6f0b73-91e0-4469-bd76-8e77fb7cdd51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2810c4e909983d65ba8735d9cfb2015b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/960473f1/uploads/origins/ad6f0b73-91e0-4469-bd76-8e77fb7cdd51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2810c4e909983d65ba8735d9cfb2015b, https://si.imgix.net/960473f1/uploads/origins/ad6f0b73-91e0-4469-bd76-8e77fb7cdd51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d684a65e21c7d3332f21b3f631c0924e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/960473f1/uploads/origins/ad6f0b73-91e0-4469-bd76-8e77fb7cdd51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20df9e8912ae010867007f8017694403 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "もしよろしければ衣装交換している高咲侑と上原歩夢をお願いします\n服装は下記ので\nhttps://x.com/nijigaku_movie/status/1904110956814516650?s=46&t=6d3DUpSAQud4n1YGgdOYhA\n歩夢の服を侑に、侑の服を歩夢にそれぞれ着させてください\n構図は膝から上までを描いた状態で\n歩夢が笑顔で侑に抱きついて、侑は少し照れた表情\n髪型は2人ともポニーテールでお願いします\n以上よろしくお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wakahima0099/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7795645f/uploads/origins/94858250-20ad-4bf7-ba3a-83714817387c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6837243c347a7e3a6c0082f56b7b032", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7795645f/uploads/origins/94858250-20ad-4bf7-ba3a-83714817387c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6837243c347a7e3a6c0082f56b7b032, https://si.imgix.net/7795645f/uploads/origins/94858250-20ad-4bf7-ba3a-83714817387c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02827865fc345921e15df8abaefda7f2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7795645f/uploads/origins/94858250-20ad-4bf7-ba3a-83714817387c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78465ff4521bc5cfc2bc71f59c3acaf3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "もしよろしければ中須かすみに着せ替えをさせられる高咲侑をお願いします\n2人の服装は下記ので\nhttps://a-onstore.jp/shop/nijigaku-retropop/tsuhan/\nかすみが侑のズボンのベルトを緩めてる感じでお願いします\n台詞は\nかすみが「侑先輩はもっと可愛いくなれますよ♪」と笑顔でいい\n侑は「少し照れるな////」と少し恥ずかしそうに指で自分のほっぺをなぞる\n以上よろしくお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wakahima0099/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b53878a/uploads/origins/ad701edc-b332-462e-8c24-58653d23f9e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d770748437c55aaa089dc040dd5d371", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b53878a/uploads/origins/ad701edc-b332-462e-8c24-58653d23f9e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d770748437c55aaa089dc040dd5d371, https://si.imgix.net/8b53878a/uploads/origins/ad701edc-b332-462e-8c24-58653d23f9e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=974a6e2c3b01f3f1897efeddbbb9c1b1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b53878a/uploads/origins/ad701edc-b332-462e-8c24-58653d23f9e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00e2c9ec9ff5b66ae7ca0de037ab79d9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello ハ i been a huge fan of your art work for about 3 years and you drawing is so amazing and I know your like YuuSetsu so much but so am I so I would like submit request commission which is YuuSetsu thank you Ok for the request will you draw Yuu and Setsuna together in ZOZO town like this one https://i.imgur.com/mUdy9oZ.jpg I want to see Yuu And Setsuna holding hand  each other thank you 🙏", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wakahima0099/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/25392e03/uploads/origins/f2404509-5878-49dd-a394-244a27d9cbf9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e254491ee320c524d43fd756c4447e9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/25392e03/uploads/origins/f2404509-5878-49dd-a394-244a27d9cbf9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e254491ee320c524d43fd756c4447e9, https://si.imgix.net/25392e03/uploads/origins/f2404509-5878-49dd-a394-244a27d9cbf9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38715985c8a48e2da01595a3424e5772 2x, https://si.imgix.net/25392e03/uploads/origins/f2404509-5878-49dd-a394-244a27d9cbf9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f576c656ecd0f7463c035a4fd40e8fa 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして！リクエストさせてください！\n\n少し特殊な癖モノのリクエストとなりますが\nご理解頂けると…🙏\n\n資料は私が制作してるゲーム風動画のワンシーンなのですが、釜戸のギミックを解いてアイテムを入手したのち釜戸が再び稼働してしまい取り残されたルビィちゃんが抜け出せずにお尻にを焼きながら飛び跳ね続けてや